{
  "date": "2025-11-23",
  "messages": [
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭐행~",
      "en": "What are you doing~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "벌써 내일이야",
      "en": "It's already tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어떠케",
      "en": "How did that happen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "저 쇼캐에 초대좀 해주새요",
      "en": "Please invite me to the showcase."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "에? 이미 최고 자리잖아",
      "en": "Huh? You're already in the best seat."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내마음속 ㅎ",
      "en": "Inside my heart. ㅎ"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "방금 좀 뻔햇어",
      "en": "That was kind of cliché just now."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "알아!!!",
      "en": "I know!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내 마음속에 있으면",
      "en": "But if you're inside my heart..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뷰는 관객석이라",
      "en": "Your view would be facing the audience."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "보지는 못하긴 하겠다",
      "en": "So you wouldn't actually be able to see me."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "그럼 저 누구봐요?",
      "en": "Then who am I supposed to look at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "웨이브~",
      "en": "WAVs~"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "중간중간 거울 한번 봐줘",
      "en": "Then look in the mirror every now and then."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "거울 중독이야 다행이라고 생각 해",
      "en": "I'm addicted to mirrors, so I guess that's fortunate."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어제도 거울이랑 같이 산듯",
      "en": "It felt like I spent all day with a mirror yesterday."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하연이는 이번 컴백에 마음 가짐이 어떻게 돼??",
      "en": "What's your mindset going into this comeback?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "심오한 질문이군",
      "en": "That's a deep question."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어떻게하면 더 이쁠 수 있을까",
      "en": "How can I become even prettier?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어떻게하면 더 잘해보일까",
      "en": "How can I perform even better?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어떻게 하면 각단이랑 더 행복할 수 있을까",
      "en": "How can I be even happier together with all of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이런 마음들이지",
      "en": "Those are the kinds of thoughts I have."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "제니스 무대가 제일 떨리고",
      "en": "The Zenith stage makes me the most nervous."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "긴장될것같은데",
      "en": "I think it'll make me really nervous."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하",
      "en": "Ha..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "벌써 떨려",
      "en": "I'm already nervous."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "잘하고싶어서 떨리는건 진짜 좋은것같아",
      "en": "Being nervous because I want to do well feels like a really good thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "열심히 안했으면 떨리지도 않아",
      "en": "If you hadn't worked hard, you wouldn't even be nervous."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그게 맞아",
      "en": "That's true."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "무대에 못 올라가서 떨리는것보다 무대에서 떨리는게 훨신 좋다고 생각해",
      "en": "I'd much rather be nervous while standing on stage than because I couldn't get on stage."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그치",
      "en": "Right."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 할수있는",
      "en": "For every stage..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "무대들엔",
      "en": "That I'm able to stand on..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "정말 최선을 다하고싶엉",
      "en": "I really want to give it my absolute best."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어제 레제하연 했잖아",
      "en": "Yesterday I did Reze Hayeon, you know."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "원래 그 컨셉이 아니였는데",
      "en": "That actually wasn't the original concept."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "원래는 걍 하나로 묶고",
      "en": "Originally I was just going to tie my hair up."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "커리어우먼 이런 느낌",
      "en": "With a career woman kind of vibe."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하려고 했는데",
      "en": "That was the plan."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "누구였는지",
      "en": "But someone..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나한테",
      "en": "Said to me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "레제야? ㅋㅋㅋㅋ",
      "en": "\"Are you Reze? ㅋㅋㅋㅋ\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "라고 해서",
      "en": "After hearing that..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "오",
      "en": "\"Oh...\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "해야지 ㅋ",
      "en": "\"I should go with that then. ㅋ\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "머리도 번으로 바꾸고",
      "en": "So I changed my hair into a bun."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "초커도 사실",
      "en": "The choker too..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아무것도 안달려있는건데",
      "en": "Originally didn't have anything attached to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "핀을 표현하기 위해서",
      "en": "But to represent Reze's pin..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "반지도 단거야 내가",
      "en": "I attached a ring myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니 무대 전부터 내가",
      "en": "Even before going on stage..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "핀 뽑는척",
      "en": "I kept pretending to pull the pin."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "퓽퓽",
      "en": "Pyung, pyung."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하고 다녔는데",
      "en": "I was going around doing that."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "유빈언니가",
      "en": "Then Yubin-unnie..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "오오~~",
      "en": "\"Ooh~~\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이러면서",
      "en": "She went..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "만지다가",
      "en": "Touched it..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㄹㅇ로 뽑은거야",
      "en": "And actually pulled it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹ 커 ㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뚝하고 끊어졌는데",
      "en": "It snapped right off."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내마음이 터졌다…",
      "en": "My heart shattered..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "근데 다시 붙여주셨어 쌤리",
      "en": "But the stylist fixed it back for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그거 완전 수작업이야",
      "en": "It was completely handmade."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "쌤이 뺀지로",
      "en": "The stylist used pliers..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "막 끊어가면서 붙힌",
      "en": "To cut and attach everything by hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "감사합니다 쌤",
      "en": "Thank you, stylist."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "썰 푸는데 신나보이네 ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ 레제 되게 맘에 들었구나",
      "en": "You sound so excited telling this story. ㅋㅋㅋㅋ You really liked the Reze concept."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "마자 나쁘지 않았어",
      "en": "Yeah, I really liked it."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "너 쌤들한테 사랑 받는 이유 알 것 같기두",
      "en": "I think I know why the stylists love you."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니 ㅋㄹㅋㅋㄹㅋ",
      "en": "Noo. ㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 대기실에서 거울보고 연습하거나",
      "en": "Whenever I'm practicing in front of the mirror in the waiting room..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "춤추고 그러면",
      "en": "Or dancing by myself..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "쌤들 달려와서",
      "en": "The stylists come running over."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너 혼자 춤추는데 왜 나한테 말 안했어!!!",
      "en": "\"Why didn't you tell me you were dancing by yourself!!!\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이러셔",
      "en": "That's what they say."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "날 킹받아하시면서",
      "en": "While pretending to be annoyed with me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "최애라고 해주셔",
      "en": "They tell me I'm their favorite."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내 마력이지",
      "en": "That's my magic."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "악마력?",
      "en": "Demon magic?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "image": "image-01.webp"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이쁘게 나온거 몇개 있ㄴ느데",
      "en": "There are a few that turned out really pretty."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "Sns에 올라갈겨",
      "en": "They'll be uploaded to SNS."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하연아 우리도 H.O.T.선배님들처럼 20년 30년 되어서도 함께 하자 그때까지도 꼬옥 노래해줘 방금 사진 보고 또 반함..",
      "en": "Hayeon, let's also stay together for 20 or 30 years like H.O.T.-sunbaenim. Please keep singing until then. I just fell for you again after seeing that photo..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어제 한터에서 무대보는게",
      "en": "Watching the stage at Hanteo yesterday..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜 뭔가",
      "en": "It really..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "감동적이였어",
      "en": "Moved me."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "오랜시간이 지나고도 다시 뭉쳐서",
      "en": "Seeing them reunite after such a long time..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "큰무대에서 기다려주신 팬분들과",
      "en": "Performing on a big stage with fans who had waited for them..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "행복하게 무대 하시는데",
      "en": "And looking so happy on stage..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나도 저렇게 되고싶다",
      "en": "I really want to become like that too."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "생각했어 진짜",
      "en": "I genuinely thought that."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "관객석 분들도 연령대가 진짜 다양했는데",
      "en": "The audience also had people of all different ages."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어릴때 좋아했던 가수를 다 커서 다시보러오는",
      "en": "It felt like they had grown up and come back to see the artists they loved when they were younger."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그런 느낌을 받아서",
      "en": "That's the feeling I got."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "감동",
      "en": "It was really touching."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "우린 다시 뭉치지말고 그냥 계속 뭉쳐서 가면 좋겠다",
      "en": "Instead of reuniting one day, I hope we can just keep staying together the whole time."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그러면 완전 좋지",
      "en": "That would be wonderful."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "10년 20년 후에 하연이를 다시 보면 기분이 어떨까",
      "en": "I wonder what it'll feel like seeing you again 10 or 20 years from now."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그러면",
      "en": "Then..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "**Y/n**의 10년전도 떠올라서 좋지 않을까?",
      "en": "Wouldn't it be nice if it also reminded you of the **Y/n** from 10 years ago?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "감동타임이였다",
      "en": "That was a touching moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하랑해 함 치자",
      "en": "Let's send one 'Haranghae.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나이제 연습 들어가야할거같아",
      "en": "I think I have to go practice now."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "좀이따 라이브에서 보자ㅏ",
      "en": "See you on the live later."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하랑해😍",
      "en": "Haranghae 😍"
    }
  ]
}